[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "Uses the existing shared `frontend/src/api` axios instance (baseURL '/api') so global interceptors apply. Exports types SessionUser { id; username; email; emailVerified }, FieldErrors { username?; email?; password?; confirmPassword?; terms?; form? }, RegisterAccountInput { username; email; password; confirmPassword; agreeToTerms }, RegisterAccountResult = { ok: true; user } | { ok: false; errors }, SignInInput/SignInResult, plus registerAccount(input), signIn(input), fetchSession(), signOut(). registerAccount POSTs /auth/register and returns { ok: false, errors } from the HTTP 400 body { errors: FieldErrors } without throwing, so the caller can render every field message at once. fetchSession GETs /auth/session returning SessionUser | null for cookie-based recovery. Cookies must remain the session transport (no localStorage token duplication).",
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "inputs": "Form payloads from RegisterPage/SignInPage; HTTP responses from the auth routes.",
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "outputs": "Typed result objects consumed by RegisterPage, SignInPage and SessionProvider.",
