[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "Simultaneous invalid fields return all field errors in one 400 body",
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "Duplicate username/email returns the matching field error and creates no row",
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "Successful registration returns a verified user and sets a session cookie usable for sign-in",
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "GET /api/auth/session returns the current user after registration/sign-in and null when anonymous"
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ]
[2026-09-26T16:09:50.483+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]     },
